# ColdTrack Control

Web dashboard for **ColdTrack Edge**, an IoT cold chain monitoring integrative project.
ESP32-C3 sensors installed inside vehicle cargo containers send temperature, humidity, and Wi-Fi signal data to an Azure API; the dashboard (React + Vite) displays the status of each cargo load, out-of-range alerts based on the merchandise profile, reports, trips, and predicted heat risk along the route.

This is the **dashboard (front-end)** repository. The API, firmware, infrastructure, and climate analysis are located in the back-end repository:
[mbalbuquerque/projeto-integrador-4-periodo](https://github.com/mbalbuquerque/projeto-integrador-4-periodo).

