## 1. About the Project

ColdTrack Control was developed as part of the Integrative Project to track environmental conditions during the transport and storage of refrigerated goods. The solution integrates the Internet of Things, web development, HTTP communication, environmental monitoring, and logistics management.

Objectives:

- monitor temperature and relative air humidity for each vehicle;
- classify each reading according to the cargo profile range (Normal, Warning, Critical);
- display Wi-Fi connectivity (RSSI) and the status of each sensor;
- record trips and display cargo conditions along each route;
- generate period-based reports with CSV export;
- separate permissions between managers and logistics operators;
- provide automated support to visitors, with escalation to the developer;
- maintain a responsive, automatically tested interface.

